<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76368" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀψοποι-ός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who cooks food, a cook</i>,
			distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτοκόπος</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτοποιός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.82
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.1.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				5.5.39
			</span></i>; from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτοποιός</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				8.5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				517e
			</span></i>; from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάγειρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				373c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				178d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκέτι μάγειρος ὀ. δ᾽ ἐστί που</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dionys.Com.
					2.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ὀ. σκευάσαι χρηστῶς μόνον δεῖ
					τοὖψον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					149.6
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς εἰωθότας τῶν λόγων
				ὀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Chor.
				<u>Brum.</u>
				14.18
			</span></i>.</div>
